{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f07a2473905de16863d14c2f4957af13462d937b8700a0be44c0640efea8a84a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bec79380c4654896f56d1027a17f0eef6508813f4231d1300e7a5a54e8b56b4",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n现在能耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6675d6089c919cb09cc4d8d696a0193186f7cc82b9b1af0f491acfdc10f69909",
      "text": "好的，没问题",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6fc2ee00142a6c8756c169340934e0e5b3ee92494ff2bafbf8769d9e6fcd9e",
      "text": "……我很挂念前阵子在鬼屋拍摄的宣传海报\n后续的反响。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e3ccbcc4465f85f51619e3069f182f184edc50de2a976a7b935b51d375d8502",
      "text": "……虽然脑海中设想了背景设定，\n但仅靠海报，是无法直接用语言传达的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3819683665952a7cd15bbc5ff36b70ea59902cb29d7335ef196ce5dc3fb0f71c",
      "text": "……我是否把那个鬼屋的世界观\n完整表现出来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81acf0792f4aaeade7ec11a18336404e38c3895aaee519b100773b106774c588",
      "text": "你的心意好好传达到了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:507ea90947365a5c2bc8125c8480d48098c8ad974e5872cd1837c1f6058ecf79",
      "text": "是的，能感受到其中的故事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be33a655fedbfb7909d1d1ee896e9054e313cccc06c0c796ae75d899c9b2a4b",
      "text": "……在制作人眼里也是这样的话，\n我就放心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d48afc6bac8087461a5898b5114b34251e0017af38b7f2a10f71315f718e0f64",
      "text": "……这样啊。多亏了和制作人\n一起把概念彻底敲定了下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:446cf2c1c7b97c1f2fa4bb59814bdc91dfd61956b6611d3eb55443ab94b7c0ec",
      "text": "……鬼怪经历了什么，怀揣着怎样的心思\n在那个场所向人类现身。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:572a8e1672ec63d8bb50dca04ecfcaf4eb9528790214371fc1dc7f18701a6c67",
      "text": "……多亏了拍摄前你听我详谈，让我能把一张\n照片背后的底蕴加深。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2691c20d6fa2fbe9c046c6f57a88807dc83fad0bc91b4bb64b700dcafede3354",
      "text": "……如果只是一味将自己的想法硬塞进去，\n我想只会变成自以为是的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43542511144afb8f4e01352024315b7ba9e85aab0ccd0a626ffe338dcfa3cd38",
      "text": "……之所以能找到正解，正是因为听取了制作人\n客观的意见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed7e72cb77108dc88d4399cad5d784394baeefeacc17db3548f745042977bfaf",
      "text": "……你特意抽出时间听我阐述，\n我由衷地感谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000039:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93d096b448d513c3252807c16888488b8b0545a54dcb00d5e4981138e7c00a15",
      "text": "……下次再有类似的机会时，\n要是还能找你商量，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:043kaz_402_2_4_043_02_09_a:2_4_043_02_09_a:cmd-000044:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc55e5cceabe508c10b0bb31f3039a3dbf9ac307eb5ce0aee2320243dbb487b",
      "text": "……谢谢。那么，之后再联络。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
